                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "c\/ Native implementation \u00b7 Pedal setup (#1026 \/ PR #1028)"
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
            "fontSize": "24",
            "fontWeight": "400",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
            "textDecoration": "none",
            "letterSpacing": "0",
            "fills": [
              {
                "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                "fillOpacity": 1
              }
            ],
            "fontFamily": "Arimo"
          },
          {
            "lineHeight": "1.3",
            "fontStyle": "normal",
            "children": [
              {
                "lineHeight": "1.3",
                "fontStyle": "normal",
                "textTransform": "none",
                "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
                "fontSize": "24",
                "fontWeight": "400",
                "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
                "textDecoration": "none",
                "letterSpacing": "0",
                "fills": [
                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "Layout A uses the accepted Fusion pedal body, rubber pad, grips and nameplate. The raised rear row keeps its full touch area. Track holds edit all four tracks together; fixed Stop, Undo, Clear and Bank stay dimmed and outside focus. Pedals is reachable from Settings and the Control tray. Stage closes that tray."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
            "fontSize": "24",
            "fontWeight": "400",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
            "textDecoration": "none",
            "letterSpacing": "0",
            "fills": [
              {
                "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                "fillOpacity": 1
              }
            ],
            "fontFamily": "Arimo"
          },
          {
            "lineHeight": "1.3",
            "fontStyle": "normal",
            "children": [
              {
                "lineHeight": "1.3",
                "fontStyle": "normal",
                "textTransform": "none",
                "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
                "fontSize": "24",
                "fontWeight": "400",
                "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
                "textDecoration": "none",
                "letterSpacing": "0",
                "fills": [
                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "Save waits for storage confirmation before activating a draft. Cancel keeps the existing setup. Failed writes restore the exact prior data; if that restoration also fails, a persistent warning and Save remain available. Unreadable explicit assignments stay inactive: \u201cSaved assignments can\u2019t be read. Review these replacements, then Save to enable them.\u201d Cancel never replaces damaged data; only a confirmed Save enables the reviewed replacement."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
            "fontSize": "24",
            "fontWeight": "400",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
            "textDecoration": "none",
            "letterSpacing": "0",
            "fills": [
              {
                "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                "fillOpacity": 1
              }
            ],
            "fontFamily": "Arimo"
          },
          {
            "lineHeight": "1.3",
            "fontStyle": "normal",
            "children": [
              {
                "lineHeight": "1.3",
                "fontStyle": "normal",
                "textTransform": "none",
                "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
                "fontSize": "24",
                "fontWeight": "400",
                "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
                "textDecoration": "none",
                "letterSpacing": "0",
                "fills": [
                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "Mode has separate Press and Hold. Record\/Play and track presses retain immediate transport contact. Track Hold acts only in Tracks; Record\/Play Hold also works in Mute. Arm overdub cannot cancel a pending arm or finish a capture started elsewhere. Bank Hold retains performance-recording access."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
            "fontSize": "24",
            "fontWeight": "400",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
            "textDecoration": "none",
            "letterSpacing": "0",
            "fills": [
              {
                "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                "fillOpacity": 1
              }
            ],
            "fontFamily": "Arimo"
          },
          {
            "lineHeight": "1.3",
            "fontStyle": "normal",
            "children": [
              {
                "lineHeight": "1.3",
                "fontStyle": "normal",
                "textTransform": "none",
                "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
                "fontSize": "24",
                "fontWeight": "400",
                "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
                "textDecoration": "none",
                "letterSpacing": "0",
                "fills": [
                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "Staged capability: this PR exposes Track controls only. Custom setup returns with its real runtime in PR #1030, together with the accepted Mode Hold \u2192 Custom default. The interim Hold \u2192 FX is not the final design. LED colors, External pedals, double-press Solo and later performance actions remain separate slices. Physical control validation still requires the appliance."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
            "fontSize": "24",
            "fontWeight": "400",
